# Code owners — the in-tree half of the fold-contract review gate.
#
# The contract touch-gate (scripts/check-contract-bump.sh) demands that any diff
# to reducers.ts either bumps EVENT_CONTRACT_VERSION or carries a self-service
# "// contract: no-bump" marker. The marker is written by the same author who
# writes the diff: no second reviewer sees the no-bump claim. These rules require
# a code owner's review on the three files where a silent fold-behavior change can
# hide — so a no-bump claim is reviewed by someone other than its author.
#
# This file is only the in-tree half. The matching enforcement — branch
# protection / required-review on these paths so a CODEOWNERS review actually
# BLOCKS merge — is a repository-admin action a human must take in the forge
# settings (GitHub: Settings → Branches → require review from Code Owners).
# Adjust the @owner below to match your forge's user or team handles.

/scripts/check-contract-bump.sh                        @purrgrammer
/packages/store/src/reducers.ts                        @purrgrammer
/packages/types/src/events.ts                          @purrgrammer
/packages/store/test/contract-surface.snapshot.json    @purrgrammer
